// Sum of kept winning labeled hammings not equal to the lower central value.
// An empty difference set returns -1, not 0. A difference of only zeros is 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE lxsm ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG lxsm rank

IMPULSE lxsm 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "lxsm" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
